       "Ram                                      8\n",
       "Memory                           512GB SSD\n",
       "Gpu                 Intel UHD Graphics 620\n",
       "OpSys                           Windows 10\n",
       "Weight                              1.88kg\n",
       "Price                             69157.44\n",
       "Panel Type                  Standard Panel\n",
       "Touchscreen                Standard Screen\n",
       "Pixel Resolution                 1920x1080\n",
       "GHz                                    1.9\n",
       "Name: 28, dtype: object"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 26,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Inspect Row 28\n",
    "df.loc[28]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c3469122",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Fix Remaining HDD Combo"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 27,
   "id": "c52d1ae0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "a = df[(df['Memory'].str.contains(r'\\+'))&~(df['Memory'].str.contains(r'SSD|Hybrid'))]\n",
    "df.loc[703, 'Memory'] = '2TB HDD'"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0ddc68aa",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Split Memory into Primary and Extra"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 28,
   "id": "cda7fcb1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df[(df['Memory'].str.contains(r'\\+'))].reset_index().to_string()\n",
    "spl_mem = df['Memory'].str.split(r'\\s*\\+\\s*',n=1,expand=True)\n",
    "df['Primary Memory'] = spl_mem[0]\n",
    "df['Extra Memory'] = spl_mem[1].fillna('No Extra Memory')\n",
    "df = df.drop(columns=['Memory'])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "164ebf38",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Check for Corrupted Memory Entries"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 29,
   "id": "e09f966c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df[df['Primary Memory'].str.contains(r'\\?')]\n",
    "df = df.drop(index=770).reset_index(drop=True)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 30,
   "id": "00e05d54",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Separating storage TYPE (SSD / HDD / Flash Storage / Hybrid)\n",
    "# from storage SIZE (the numeric GB or TB value).\n",
    "# Applied to both Primary Memory and Extra Memory.\n",
    "#\n",
    "# Logic:\n",
    "#   Step 1: Extract non-digit characters as the type label\n",
    "#   Step 2: Clean up punctuation from the extracted type\n",
    "#   Step 3: Replace empty strings with NaN (proper missing value)\n",
    "#   Step 4: Cast to category (limited distinct values)\n",
    "#   Step 5: Strip type labels from size column, leaving only numbers"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 31,
   "id": "309aaee8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Primary Memory\n",
    "df['Primary Memory Type'] = df['Primary Memory'].str.extract(r'(\\b\\D+)')\n",
    "df['Primary Memory Type'] = df['Primary Memory Type'].str.replace(r'[+.-]','',regex=True).str.strip()\n",
    "df['Primary Memory Type'] = df['Primary Memory Type'].replace('',np.nan)\n",
    "df['Primary Memory Type'] = df['Primary Memory Type'].str.strip().astype('category')\n",
    "df['Primary Memory'] = df['Primary Memory'].str.replace('GB','').str.replace('HDD','').str.replace('Flash Storage','').str.replace('Hybrid','').str.replace('SSD','')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Extra Memory\n",
    "df['Extra Memory Type'] = df['Extra Memory'].str.extract(r'(\\b\\D+)')\n",
    "df['Extra Memory Type'] = df['Extra Memory Type'].str.replace(r'[+.-]','',regex=True).str.strip()\n",
    "df['Extra Memory Type'] = df['Extra Memory Type'].replace('',np.nan)\n",
    "df['Extra Memory Type'] = df['Extra Memory Type'].str.strip().astype('category')\n",
    "df['Extra Memory'] = df['Extra Memory'].str.replace('HDD','').str.replace('Flash Storage','').str.replace('Hybrid','').str.replace('SSD','')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1b0f5da3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Convert TB to GB"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 32,
   "id": "a9405b2d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df[df['Primary Memory'].str.contains(r'TB')]     # preview TB entries\n",
    "def tb_to_gb(x):\n",
    "    x = str(x).strip().lower()\n",
    "    if 'tb' in x:\n",
    "        return float(x.replace('tb',''))*1000\n",
    "    return x\n",
    "df['Primary Memory'] = df['Primary Memory'].apply(tb_to_gb)\n",
    "df['Extra Memory'] = df['Extra Memory'].apply(tb_to_gb)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 33,
   "id": "b87fc86b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Applying .str.title() to standardise the text casing.\n",
    "df['Extra Memory'] = df['Extra Memory'].astype(str).str.title()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "78e89efb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Final Numeric Extraction for Memory Columns"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 34,
   "id": "089bc194",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df['Primary Memory']=df['Primary Memory'].str.extract(r'(\\d+)')\n",
    "df['Extra Memory']=df['Extra Memory'].str.extract(r'(\\d+)')\n",
    "df['Primary Memory'] = df['Primary Memory'].fillna(0).astype('int')\n",
    "df['Extra Memory'] = df['Extra Memory'].fillna(0).astype('int')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b31f913c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 25. Extract GPU Brand"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 35,
   "id": "79cf0d0f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def brand(x):\n",
    "    x = x.lower()\n",
    "    if 'amd' in x:\n",
    "        return 'AMD'\n",
    "    elif 'intel' in x:\n",
    "        return 'INTEL'\n",
    "    elif 'nvidia' in x:\n",
    "        return 'NVIDIA'\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        return 'UNKNOWN'\n",
    "df['Gpu Brand'] = df['Gpu'].apply(brand)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "73f04514",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 26. Cast Operating System to Category"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 36,
   "id": "965fd35c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df['OpSys'] = df['OpSys'].astype('category')"
   ]
  },
